────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The widget optionally loads three typefaces from Google Fonts. They are not
part of this repository and carry their own licenses:

  Noto Serif Tibetan, IBM Plex Sans, Fraunces — SIL Open Font License 1.1
  https://openfontlicense.org/

The rivers and lakes were derived from Natural Earth, which places its data in
the public domain and asks for no attribution. It is credited here because
knowing where a map's geometry came from is useful, not because anything is
owed:

  Natural Earth — https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
  ne_10m_rivers_lake_centerlines, ne_10m_lakes
